## Features

- **HTTP**: `httpx` async client with retries (`tenacity`) and concurrency control
- **Parsing**: `beautifulsoup4` + `lxml` + `markdownify` (HTML → markdown)
- **AI crawler**: `crawl4ai` for LLM-friendly extraction
{% if include_playwright -%}
- **Browser**: `playwright` runner for JS-heavy pages
{% endif -%}
{% if include_scrapy -%}
- **Scrapy**: spiders package wired to `scrapy-playwright`
{% endif -%}
{% if include_cli -%}
- **CLI**: `typer` + `rich` (`{{ project_slug }} --help`), progress bars via `tqdm`
{% endif -%}
{% if include_api -%}
- **API**: `fastapi` + `uvicorn` (`/health`, `/scrape/url`, ...) with `fastapi-users` auth
{% endif -%}
- **Storage**: pluggable — JSONL (default), SQLAlchemy async (SQLite / PostgreSQL / Supabase); Mongo + Kafka planned
- **Page stats**: per-page counters (requests, clicks, screenshots, videos, LLM calls + tokens, extraction outcomes) + heuristic page-complexity score, persisted alongside every record
- **Templating**: `Jinja2`
- **Settings**: `pydantic-settings` layered over `.env` + `config.yaml`
- **Logging**: `structlog`
- **Dev**: `ruff` + `mypy` + `pre-commit`

